---
manual: styles.fill
lines: [1202, 1210]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 200 do
  strokewidth 4
  @shape = oval left: 50, top: 50, width: 100, height: 80, fill: red, stroke: blue
end
----------- test code
r, g, b, = pixel_at(100, 90)
assert(r > 200 && g < 60 && b < 60, "the inside of the oval is painted with the fill colour, got #{[r, g, b]}")
r, g, b, = pixel_at(51, 90)
assert(b > 200 && r < 60, "while its outline keeps the stroke colour, got #{[r, g, b]}")
